.TH POPAUTH "1" "" "FSF" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
popauth \- manual page for popauth (GNU Mailutils)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B popauth
[\fIOPTION\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
GNU popauth \fB\-\-\fR manage POP3 authentication database
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
Report bugs to <bug-mailutils@gnu.org>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
The full documentation for
.B popauth
is maintained as a Texinfo manual.  If the
.B info
and
.B popauth
programs are properly installed at your site, the command
.IP
.B info popauth
.PP
should give you access to the complete manual.
